  "alternateName": "Universitat de Barcelona",
  "description": "Public research university founded in 1450 in Barcelona, Catalonia, Spain. Operates no public developer portal and publishes no OpenAPI. Its institution-operated machine-readable surfaces are a SAML 2.0 identity provider federated through RedIRIS SIR into eduGAIN, an LTI 1.3 Advantage tool platform on its self-hosted Moodle, an OAI-PMH 2.0 data provider over its OJS journal platform, and a DSpace 7.6.6 repository that was returning HTTP 503 host-wide on 2026-09-01.",
